<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Internship Application Form</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { text-align: center; margin-top: 0; }
        .header-section { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .form-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
        .full-width { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
        .label-field { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .label-field span:first-child { font-weight: bold; }
        .input-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; padding-bottom: 2px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 5px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="header-section">
            <h1>SOUTHWEST MINNESOTA STATE UNIVERSITY</h1>
            <h2>NORTH STAR MUTUAL SCHOOL OF BUSINESS</h2>
            <h3>INTERNSHIP APPLICATION FORM</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">The Internship Program</div>
        <p>The Internship Program at <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> in the <span data-field="school_name">{{ school_name }}</span> is designed to give exposure to real-life business operations during the third year and beyond. The internships provide an opportunity to gain first-hand knowledge of business practices and should be beneficial to both the student and the employer.</p>

        <ol>
            <li>The Internship Program attempts to provide the student with a practical environment in which he/she can apply the theory, practices, and skills acquired in coursework. Thus, the internship provides a learning experience where the students can integrate their college education within the context of a work environment.</li>
            <li>The internship provides the employer with an intern for a specific semester. A participating employer receives benefits beyond having an additional employee:
                <ol type="A">
                    <li>An internship provides an employer an opportunity to observe and evaluate a student for potential as a future employee. Challenging internship opportunities attract academically strong students. Therefore, an internship provides the firm an opportunity to expose these outstanding students to the opportunities and challenges within their organization.</li>
                    <li>An internship program can increase the visibility of the firm and its image on campus among students. Positive work experiences will be discussed with other students and thus increase the pool of potential employees.</li>
                    <li>The internship can provide a method for acquiring capable personnel to conduct special projects or studies within the firm.</li>
                    <li>A firm is making a major contribution to the education of the student and provides a major educational service, as well as becoming a partner in the educational process.</li>
                </ol>
            </li>
        </ol>

        <div class="section-title">Additional information on the Internship Program at <span data-field="university_name">{{ university_name }}</span> in the <span data-field="school_name">{{ school_name }}</span> can be obtained by contacting the departmental office at the address below:</div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
            <p><span data-field="employer_name">{{ employer_name }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="employer_address_line1">{{ employer_address_line1 }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="employer_city_state_zip">{{ employer_city_state_zip }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="employer_email">{{ employer_email }}</span></p>
            <p><span data-field="employer_phone">{{ employer_phone }}</span></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div class="header-section">
            <h2>NORTH STAR MUTUAL SCHOOL OF BUSINESS</h2>
            <h3>INTERNSHIP PROGRAM</h3>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">Responsibilities of the North Star Mutual School of Business Faculty in the Internship Program</div>
        <ol>
            <li>The Faculty member who serves as an internship advisor will monitor the student's progress through biweekly reports, and conduct at least one interview of the student and the employer during the internship.</li>
            <li>Contact potential students with internship information when available, do preliminary screening as specified by the employer and make arrangements for interviews.</li>
            <li>Grade the student based on the basis of the employer evaluation, student bi-weekly reports, and final written report.</li>
            <li>Conduct a telephone interview with the employer if the employer evaluation raises questions that need defining.</li>
            <li>Have an internship advisor available to assist the employer and student throughout the internship process.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="section-title">Responsibilities of the Student in the Internship Program</div>
        <ol>
            <li>The student must complete the attached Internship Application and establish with the employer objectives to be completed for the internship to be considered successful. The completed application should be returned to the faculty advisor before the beginning of the internship.</li>
            <li>Once the application is received, the faculty advisor will complete the necessary steps to permit the student to register for the credits being pursued.</li>
            <li>The intern MUST submit a biweekly report on tasks performed and employment experiences. The reports are used to determine the intern's track of internship progress; therefore, it is imperative they be submitted every other Friday after completing the week's work. After determining the objectives with the employer, the intern should create a biweekly report template, which should include:
                <ul>
                    <li>Header should include: Name, Date, Biweekly Report #, Hours Worked during Biweekly Period, and Total Number of Hours Worked in the Internship to date. This second number is a rolling total.</li>
                    <li>Each objective numbered and bolded with space underneath to write biweekly accomplishments and progress.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
            <li>The intern, after the completion of the internship, will write a five-page report evaluating the internship experience. The report should contain the following:
                <ol type="A">
                    <li>An explanation of how the established objectives were accomplished.</li>
                    <li>An objective was not accomplished, an explanation should be given plus recommendations on how the internship could be altered to achieve the objective.</li>
                    <li>A discussion of personal strengths and weaknesses identified through the internship experience.</li>
                    <li>An evaluation of the strengths and weaknesses of the internship with recommendations for improvement.</li>
                    <li>An indication of how the internship affected his/her career choice and why.</li>
                    <li>Proper spelling and grammar.</li>
                </ol>
            </li>
            <li>Upon completion of internship hours, the intern will need to contact the Advisor for an Employer Internship Evaluation form to be filled out by the Intern's employer.</li>
            <li>The Internship Program offers the internship a semester of 3 (300 hours) or 6 (600 hours) credits. Only three credits will count toward the degree requirement for the internship. The employer and student will agree on any credit load. The grade determination will be made based on the reports and employer evaluation.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div class="header-section">
            <h2>SOUTHWEST MINNESOTA STATE UNIVERSITY</h2>
            <h3>NORTH STAR MUTUAL SCHOOL OF BUSINESS</h3>
            <h4>STUDENT INTERNSHIP APPLICATION</h4>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">Personal Information:</div>
        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="label-field"><span>Name:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="name">{{ name }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>Last:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="last">{{ last }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>First:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="first">{{ first }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>Middle:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="middle">{{ middle }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="full-width">
            <div class="label-field"><span>Student Mustang ID:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="student_mustang_id">{{ student_mustang_id }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>Current Address:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="current_address">{{ current_address }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="label-field"><span>Current Phone No. E-mail:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="current_phone_no_e_mail">{{ current_phone_no_e_mail }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>Address Permanent Address:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="address_permanent_address">{{ address_permanent_address }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="label-field"><span>Permanent Phone No.:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="permanent_phone_no">{{ permanent_phone_no }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>Major:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="major">{{ major }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>Minor:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="minor">{{ minor }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>College:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="college">{{ college }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="label-field"><span>Year in College:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="year_in_college">{{ year_in_college }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>GPA:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="gpa">{{ gpa }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field full-width"><span>Credit Earned:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="credit_earned">{{ credit_earned }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field full-width"><span>Expected Graduation Date:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="expected_graduation_date">{{ expected_graduation_date }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">Internship Information: (See #5 under "Responsibilities of the Student in the Internship Program.")</div>
        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="label-field"><span>No. of Hours Worked Per Week:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="no_of_hours_worked_per_week">{{ no_of_hours_worked_per_week }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>No. of Weeks in Internship:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="no_of_weeks_in_internship">{{ no_of_weeks_in_internship }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>No. of Credits Desired:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="no_of_credits_desired">{{ no_of_credits_desired }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span>to</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="to">{{ to }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field full-width"><span>Internship Period:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="internship_period">{{ internship_period }}</span></div>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 10px;">
            <div class="label-field"><span></span><span>Month/Day/Year</span></div>
            <div class="label-field"><span></span><span>Month/Day/Year</span></div>
        </div>


        <div class="section-title">Faculty Advisor (*Optional)</div>
        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="label-field full-width"><span>Internship Organization Information:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="internship_organization_information">{{ internship_organization_information }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field full-width"><span>Name of Organization Department:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="name_of_organization_department">{{ name_of_organization_department }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field full-width"><span>Address Phone No.:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="address_phone_no">{{ address_phone_no }}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-title">Supervisor's Name & Title Supervisor's Phone No.</div>
        <div class="form-grid">
            <div class="label-field full-width"><span>Supervisor's Name & Title:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="supervisor_s_name_title">{{ supervisor_s_name_title }}</span></div>
            <div class="label-field full-width"><span>Supervisor's E-mail Address:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="supervisor_s_e_mail_address">{{ supervisor_s_e_mail_address }}</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div class="header-section">
            <h2>INTERNSHIP OBJECTIVES</h2>
        </div>

        <p>The Student and employer should establish 10 objectives to be accomplished by the internship. The employer's evaluation of the student's performance is to be based on the objectives established.</p>

        <ol>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="internship_objectives">{{ internship_objectives }}</span></li>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="internship_objectives_2">{{ internship_objectives_2 }}</span></li>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="internship_objectives_3">{{ internship_objectives_3 }}</span></li>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="field_1">{{ field_1 }}</span></li>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="field_2">{{ field_2 }}</span></li>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="field_3">{{ field_3 }}</span></li>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="field_4">{{ field_4 }}</span></li>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="field_5">{{ field_5 }}</span></li>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="field_6">{{ field_6 }}</span></li>
            <li><span class="input-line" data-field="field_7">{{ field_7 }}</span></li>
        </ol>

        <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div style="width: 45%;">
                    <div class="label-field"><span>Intern's Name:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="intern_s_name">{{ intern_s_name }}</span></div>
                    <div class="label-field"><span>Intern's Signature:</span> <span class="signature-line" data-field="intern_s_signature">{{ intern_s_signature }}</span></div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
                    <div class="label-field"><span>Date:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="date">{{ date }}</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 60px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div style="width: 45%;">
                    <div class="label-field"><span>Supervisor's Name:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="supervisor_s_name">{{ supervisor_s_name }}</span></div>
                    <div class="label-field"><span>Supervisor's Signature:</span> <span class="signature-line" data-field="supervisor_s_signature">{{ supervisor_s_signature }}</span></div>
                </div>
                <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
                    <div class="label-field"><span>Date:</span> <span class="input-line" data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>